      "post_id": "81886",
      "author_handle": "laineyk",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "Yipee, 8 Days old and we get home. (I was in hospital for 12 days not fun!!)\nAs most of you know i went in on the 24th June to be induced however it didnt work this time so i was sectioned on friday 26th and a gorgeous boy was born (im biased i know), Lewis spent his first night with me on the ward however on the Saturday morning he was transferred to special care and spent the first week of his little life there, he was having breathing difficulties and they think he had some sort of infection (Not GBS this time thankfully), the poor wee soul was bombarded with antibiotics, pricked constantly for blood and im so glad that he wont remember a single bit of it!\nAnyway he is thriving now he is a wonderful baby and im am so chuffed and overwhelmed with love for this little guy!\nOur first night at home was bliss, he only woke twice for feeds through the night and i feel as fresh as a daisy this morning, its so true that you cant beat your own bed and of course Daddy for doing one of the feeds throught the night.\nIll put some photos on at some point today.\nExx",
